{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22198","headline":"荅故人 · 白居易","name":"荅故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人对酒叹，叹我在天涯。\n见我昔荣遇，念我今蹉跎。\n问我爲司马，官意复如何。\n荅云且勿叹，听我爲君歌。\n我本蓬荜人，鄙贱剧泥沙。\n读书未百卷，信口嘲风花。\n自从筮仕来，六命三登科。\n顾慙虚劣姿，所得亦已多。\n散员足庇身，薄俸可资家。\n省分辄自媿，岂爲不遇耶。\n烦君对杯酒，爲我一咨蹉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}